From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 18:08:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): logotype as window icon, generated sizes, README
 and site favicon

cargo xtask logo makes the PNG sizes and camcraft.ico from the maintainer's
artwork; the shell window loads the 128 px icon; README and the site show it.

Refs #1459

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
